Package: CGRphylo
Type: Package
Title: Chaos Game Representation and Phylogenetic Distance Analysis
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Amarinder", "Thind", email = "thind.amarinder@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4592-0380"))
Description: This package implements a phylogenetic pipeline based on Chaos Game
 Representation (CGR) of DNA sequences. It enables sequence filtering, k-mer
 frequency matrix creation, distance matrix calculation, CGR plotting, and
 phylogenetic tree construction. It supports output in MEGA and PHYLIP formats
 and integrates with tools such as ape and treeio for visualization.
